graph LR
    StudentMFE["Student MFE"]
    OrganiserMFE["Organiser MFE"]

    subgraph Services["Microservices"]
        UserService["user-service<br/>👤"]
        EventService["event-service<br/>📅"]
        RegService["registration-service<br/>✓"]
        SemanticService["semantic-service<br/>🧠"]
        TicketService["ticket-service<br/>🎫"]
    end

    StudentMFE -->|authenticate| UserService
    StudentMFE -->|discover events| EventService
    StudentMFE -->|register| RegService
    StudentMFE -->|get recommendations| SemanticService
    StudentMFE -->|view/download tickets| TicketService

    OrganiserMFE -->|authenticate| UserService
    OrganiserMFE -->|create/manage events| EventService
    OrganiserMFE -->|view registrations| RegService
    OrganiserMFE -->|check-in participants| RegService

    RegService -->|verify capacity| EventService
    RegService -->|log activity| UserService

    TicketService -->|verify registration| RegService
    TicketService -->|issue credential| UserService

    SemanticService -->|consume event data| EventService
    SemanticService -->|consume user data| UserService
    SemanticService -->|consume registrations| RegService

    style UserService fill:#2196F3,color:#fff
    style EventService fill:#FF9800,color:#fff
    style RegService fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style SemanticService fill:#9C27B0,color:#fff
    style TicketService fill:#F44336,color:#fff
